#: inc/dashboard/html-wpvibe-banner.php:55
msgid "Connect your WordPress site and Botiga to AI assistants like Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, and more. Ask them to find brand guidelines, build pages, or edit sections in plain English. No copy-pasting, no exports. Connect them with the free WPVibe.ai plugin."
